WEBVTT

00:00:07.987 --> 00:00:11.282
This is your last chance
to surrender, Garou!

00:00:12.325 --> 00:00:14.827
Not how you figured
you'd be going out, huh?

00:00:15.578 --> 00:00:18.039
Well, that's just too bad,
hero hunter.

00:00:18.956 --> 00:00:23.294
Every hero here is a veteran who's
faced down death countless times.

00:00:23.628 --> 00:00:27.256
I brought in the heroes
I personally know are the best...

00:00:27.423 --> 00:00:29.050
just to hunt your ass down!

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.220
"The best," you say?

00:00:35.139 --> 00:00:37.975
Am I the only one who feels
something's off about that term?

00:00:38.601 --> 00:00:40.936
Where are the Class S heroes?

00:00:42.021 --> 00:00:45.441
Doesn't the Hero Association
understand how dangerous I am?

00:00:46.108 --> 00:00:50.905
These bargain-basement mediocrities
barely get my blood up!

00:00:51.405 --> 00:00:54.575
So even a criminal like you
cares only about Class S, eh?

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.371
They sure are popular,
the Class S heroes.

00:00:59.372 --> 00:01:02.500
They get paid off the charts
by the Hero Association,

00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:07.463
and they get let in on secrets
that we're not privy to.

00:01:08.005 --> 00:01:10.383
Even though we're all heroes,
the gap is huge!

00:01:11.425 --> 00:01:14.720
The rankings to decide
who's on top are so arbitrary

00:01:15.304 --> 00:01:18.307
that lots of capable heroes
don't get fairly recognized.

00:01:19.517 --> 00:01:22.895
They may not be Class S,
but they're still tough as hell.

00:01:23.813 --> 00:01:24.772
And you!

00:01:24.855 --> 00:01:28.109
You've gotten all this attention
for taking out Class S heroes.

00:01:28.567 --> 00:01:31.904
That makes you the perfect target
for proving my point!

00:01:34.782 --> 00:01:36.742
So that's why
there's no Class S here.

00:01:36.867 --> 00:01:38.994
You guys want to take
all the credit.

00:01:39.954 --> 00:01:41.956
Any kid who heard you
would be so let down.

00:01:43.582 --> 00:01:46.836
It's hard to breathe...
I feel dizzy, too.

00:01:47.878 --> 00:01:48.462
The poison?

00:01:50.589 --> 00:01:54.051
I heard there's some "Monster Association"
kicking your teeth in.

00:01:54.427 --> 00:01:57.012
You sure a loner like me
should be your priority?

00:01:57.346 --> 00:02:00.307
What about that hostage
who needs rescuing?

00:02:00.391 --> 00:02:03.310
Once you're dealt with,
the Monster Association comes next.

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:09.108
We'll be the ones to take
all you upstart monsters out.

00:02:10.359 --> 00:02:11.902
These guys are just steps...

00:02:15.531 --> 00:02:18.951
...on my path to becoming
a true monster.

00:02:19.869 --> 00:02:21.662
I'm not backing down!

00:02:30.004 --> 00:02:31.422
The poison's taken effect.

00:02:31.797 --> 00:02:33.382
He can't take much more.

00:02:34.717 --> 00:02:36.635
It takes one step at a time...

00:02:37.261 --> 00:02:38.721
...to make it to the top!

00:02:53.903 --> 00:02:55.863
Through the once tranquil town

00:02:55.946 --> 00:02:58.240
A thunderous roar peals forth

00:02:58.324 --> 00:03:02.203
Watch out! Freak out! Monsters!

00:03:03.078 --> 00:03:05.247
Who ts going to take the lead

00:03:03.078 --> 00:03:05.247
Who is going to take the lead

00:03:05.289 --> 00:03:07.750
When we destroy the evil ones?

00:03:07.833 --> 00:03:12.546
Destruction, contusion...
Loosen up!

00:03:12.588 --> 00:03:14.590
We know, We are...

00:03:14.757 --> 00:03:17.258
HEROES!

00:03:17.259 --> 00:03:19.011
Why were you

00:03:19.136 --> 00:03:21.305
born of evil?

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:23.390
If you wish to know

00:03:23.516 --> 00:03:25.768
I shall tell!

00:03:25.935 --> 00:03:31.816
This night the punching fist
of glorious justice

00:03:31.982 --> 00:03:35.277
Will shatter your fate apart!

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:41.158
That word exists for you
and you alone

00:03:41.283 --> 00:03:45.830
Raise your silent fist
to the sky!

00:03:45.955 --> 00:03:50.501
The apostle bears
the weight of solitude

00:03:50.626 --> 00:03:56.632
For a peace not filled
with hatred

00:03:56.757 --> 00:04:00.094
He must fight!

00:04:10.771 --> 00:04:12.565
Did you see Justice Man
yesterday?

00:04:12.815 --> 00:04:15.943
He finally used a new attack:
Justice Fire Kick!

00:04:16.026 --> 00:04:17.486
Yeah, it was so cool!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.197
But you know the best part?

00:04:20.489 --> 00:04:22.283
The way Crab Deron died!

00:04:22.408 --> 00:04:26.412
Remember his face when Justice Man
saw the egg he was trying to hide?

00:04:28.664 --> 00:04:31.208
But Crab Demon almost had him...

00:04:31.333 --> 00:04:34.211
When Mach Woman
and Little Justice joined in,

00:04:34.336 --> 00:04:37.339
It was three vs. one, but he still
didn't give up! It was so cool!

00:04:39.425 --> 00:04:40.301
What the...?

00:04:40.384 --> 00:04:43.345
Why're you rooting for Crab Demon?

00:04:43.637 --> 00:04:47.349
Crab Demon was only trying
to stop ocean pollution.

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:50.519
And he was fighting all by himself.

00:04:50.686 --> 00:04:53.439
If hed been a little stronger,
he would've won.

00:04:56.358 --> 00:04:57.943
I feel so sorry for him.

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:03.782
THE VARIETIES OF PRIDE

00:05:05.367 --> 00:05:06.201
Now!

00:05:06.994 --> 00:05:08.120
Ankle Noose!

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:10.289
Earth Rotation of Doom!

00:05:11.957 --> 00:05:12.917
What's he doing?!

00:05:17.046 --> 00:05:18.047
Chain Toad!

00:05:21.634 --> 00:05:22.593
He's down...

00:05:24.553 --> 00:05:27.181
The snake's got a blade
or something!

00:05:28.474 --> 00:05:30.476
Like I'm not allowed
to have one?

00:05:30.726 --> 00:05:32.311
Talk about discrimination.

00:05:38.776 --> 00:05:41.862
He's been hit in the leg
and porsoned, but still.../

00:05:42.988 --> 00:05:43.948
Look out!

00:05:44.073 --> 00:05:45.074
He's mine.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.367
Bison Pile Driver!

00:05:50.746 --> 00:05:51.705
Keep your distance!

00:05:52.456 --> 00:05:54.041
What?! When did he...?!

00:05:57.419 --> 00:05:58.128
Damn it!

00:05:58.253 --> 00:05:59.296
He's figured out our timing,

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:02.091
but he's wide open trom the front.

00:06:06.303 --> 00:06:07.262
No!

00:06:09.932 --> 00:06:11.100
Put me down, dammit!

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:13.894
Roar, Bamboo Shoot!

00:06:20.275 --> 00:06:21.276
Halfway there...

00:06:25.698 --> 00:06:26.824
Death Gatling...

00:06:27.574 --> 00:06:29.451
He might get us all at this rate.

00:06:30.202 --> 00:06:32.037
Let's forget about
taking him alive.

00:06:32.413 --> 00:06:33.372
Agreed.

00:06:34.373 --> 00:06:36.166
He made his choice.

00:06:41.672 --> 00:06:43.465
He still can move at that speed?!

00:06:46.176 --> 00:06:48.137
He should be completely
worn down by now,

00:06:48.595 --> 00:06:50.639
but somehow, he has us
fighting his fight.

00:06:51.015 --> 00:06:54.268
It definitely doesn't feel like
we re fighting a human!

00:06:55.144 --> 00:06:56.478
Stinger!

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.981
Fight me one-on-one!

00:07:00.315 --> 00:07:02.651
I accept your challenge!
Everyone, stay out of this!

00:07:02.735 --> 00:07:04.695
Don't! We have to fight together!

00:07:05.487 --> 00:07:06.905
I'll turn him into bone fragments!

00:07:08.449 --> 00:07:09.408
What the—?!

00:07:16.415 --> 00:07:18.959
Lucky for me you're as dumb
as they say, Stinger!

00:07:19.043 --> 00:07:20.002
You tricked me...!

00:07:20.169 --> 00:07:21.128
Out of the way!

00:07:22.337 --> 00:07:22.963
I'll do this!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:26.008
Garou can't dodge my rapid fire
in his condition!

00:07:34.641 --> 00:07:35.934
Move away from Garou!

00:07:36.977 --> 00:07:38.520
Hey, what's the matter?!

00:07:38.896 --> 00:07:40.647
We were so close a second ago...

00:07:40.773 --> 00:07:42.775
Why run away from me now?

00:07:43.108 --> 00:07:44.693
I'm gonna be all lonely!

00:07:45.194 --> 00:07:46.278
I cant shake him!

00:07:46.987 --> 00:07:48.238
He's using Megane as a shield!

00:07:48.614 --> 00:07:49.615
I dont have a shot...

00:07:54.119 --> 00:07:58.373
With our formation busted,
am I just holding them back now?

00:08:01.043 --> 00:08:03.712
The new guy's just holding us back.

00:08:04.213 --> 00:08:07.633
I don't want to share
the credit with fim.

00:08:09.718 --> 00:08:12.471
I dont need credit...
You all take it.

00:08:20.479 --> 00:08:21.438
This Is It...

00:08:22.731 --> 00:08:23.732
I'm gonna be killed...!

00:08:37.079 --> 00:08:38.747
I never be a hero...

00:08:40.082 --> 00:08:41.542
I'm just an ordinary guy...

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:43.418
.../'ve reached my hmit!

00:08:43.877 --> 00:08:44.837
Limit?

00:08:45.504 --> 00:08:47.172
Who decides what your limit is?

00:08:50.425 --> 00:08:52.511
Instead of overthinking setbacks,

00:08:53.846 --> 00:08:55.681
Just move forward.

00:08:57.391 --> 00:09:00.227
That's when I decided to
remake myself.

00:09:02.604 --> 00:09:03.564
To be like him!

00:09:05.023 --> 00:09:06.650
I won't be used as cover.

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.360
ld rather fight to the—

00:09:09.945 --> 00:09:12.197
Oh ho! That's the spirit!

00:09:12.573 --> 00:09:14.616
You've got lots of stamina, right?

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:15.617
Bastard!

00:09:15.742 --> 00:09:17.119
Stinger! It's a trap!

00:09:17.619 --> 00:09:20.289
Maybe it is, but I can't ignore it!

00:09:20.372 --> 00:09:24.418
Gigantic Drill Stinger!

00:09:41.852 --> 00:09:44.271
You took out your meatshields...

00:09:45.314 --> 00:09:47.983
Now I don't have to worry
about friendly fire.

00:09:48.442 --> 00:09:51.445
You're dead, Garou the monster!

00:09:54.948 --> 00:09:56.491
There's a kid inside the shack.

00:09:58.619 --> 00:10:00.495
He'll get hit
if you shoot from there.

00:10:00.996 --> 00:10:02.706
Trying to talk your way out...

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.667
...With a lie so completely obvious?

00:10:09.379 --> 00:10:10.464
See this now!

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:13.508
The moment the monster wins!

00:10:15.427 --> 00:10:17.012
The winner will be justice.

00:10:17.596 --> 00:10:18.555
Time to die!

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:21.225
Death Shower!

00:10:33.695 --> 00:10:34.655
Impossible...

00:10:38.033 --> 00:10:39.451
How could he survive that?!

00:10:43.538 --> 00:10:45.582
M-Mister...

00:10:48.543 --> 00:10:50.629
Only an idiot would
let loose like that.

00:10:52.047 --> 00:10:53.298
Don't bother with the act.

00:10:54.174 --> 00:10:55.175
See, I know.

00:10:55.592 --> 00:10:58.637
That was "Death Shower," where
you use up all your ammo.

00:10:59.137 --> 00:11:01.306
He goaded me
like he did the others.

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:04.851
"Monsters it hits are turned
into mincemeat and obliterated."

00:11:05.394 --> 00:11:07.396
But not quite, eh?

00:11:08.689 --> 00:11:09.815
I'm grateful!

00:11:10.816 --> 00:11:13.902
You proved I can't be
defeated by guns.

00:11:15.279 --> 00:11:17.572
Not how you figured
you'd be going out, that it?

00:11:18.991 --> 00:11:21.285
Too bad for you,
but that's how foils work.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:25.330
You shoulda called in some Class S
heroes like good little Class A's.

00:11:26.123 --> 00:11:30.127
If even one of them had joined you,
things might've been different.

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:32.963
Screw Class S!

00:11:33.588 --> 00:11:36.133
You think the rest of us
are just second string?

00:11:36.925 --> 00:11:38.844
Class S heroes are incredible...

00:11:39.303 --> 00:11:43.724
But we fight through
blood and death, same as them!

00:11:44.099 --> 00:11:45.058
Look at me!

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:47.519
I cornered the hero hunter!

00:11:47.811 --> 00:11:50.814
I am the Class A hero,
Death Gatling!

00:11:52.024 --> 00:11:53.525
You got issues, brother.

00:11:53.817 --> 00:11:55.485
I, not them, will defeat you!

00:11:56.278 --> 00:11:58.530
To show that we deserve
to have our place!

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.950
Seems the one
most obsessed with rankings...

00:12:02.659 --> 00:12:04.453
...lS you, dumbass!

00:12:11.626 --> 00:12:12.627
You disgust me.

00:12:17.549 --> 00:12:18.925
Idiots...

00:12:19.551 --> 00:12:21.053
M-Mister...

00:12:26.141 --> 00:12:27.642
You're still alive...

00:12:39.196 --> 00:12:40.989
Somebody help!

00:12:56.838 --> 00:12:59.007
W-Water...

00:13:05.305 --> 00:13:07.516
I received a call for assistance.

00:13:08.308 --> 00:13:10.894
From the look of it,
you are that hero hunter...

00:13:17.192 --> 00:13:19.653
I will eliminate you.

00:13:48.557 --> 00:13:49.850
Machinegun Blows!

00:13:54.438 --> 00:13:56.565
Fist of Flowing Water
Crushing Rock!

00:14:08.076 --> 00:14:09.828
Die!

00:14:17.919 --> 00:14:21.381
Bastard... He let me bury him
to lure me in.

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:26.761
This man...

00:14:27.846 --> 00:14:31.308
... defended using Fist of Flowing
Water Crushing Rock.

00:14:32.893 --> 00:14:33.852
I understand now...

00:14:35.103 --> 00:14:37.105
This is why the other
heroes struggled.

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.108
Okay! I'm gonna do this!

00:14:40.192 --> 00:14:42.569
You got like a millimeter
of health left!

00:14:42.694 --> 00:14:44.779
Guess I've gotten better than you!

00:14:46.114 --> 00:14:47.491
Oh? Still got some fight left?

00:14:47.866 --> 00:14:48.742
Hold on a sec.

00:14:48.825 --> 00:14:49.784
Stay calm, Saitama...

00:14:49.868 --> 00:14:51.620
One more hit and I win.

00:14:51.828 --> 00:14:54.164
It'd take a miracle for him
to comeback n—

00:14:54.623 --> 00:14:55.832
K.O.!

00:15:00.003 --> 00:15:01.004
So how was that?

00:15:01.379 --> 00:15:03.965
I set up for a last-gasp,
come-from-behind win.

00:15:04.341 --> 00:15:05.800
Hope you had a little fun,
at least.

00:15:06.218 --> 00:15:09.346
I wouldn't let you win,
but I'll let you get this close.

00:15:09.971 --> 00:15:12.390
I mean, your moves are
always the same.

00:15:12.474 --> 00:15:15.101
I gave you a chance, but all you do
is spam the same button.

00:15:15.185 --> 00:15:16.811
I could beat you
with my eyes closed.

00:15:17.312 --> 00:15:19.314
This puts us at 81-0.

00:15:19.439 --> 00:15:22.526
I'll loan you the console,
so try practicing a bit.

00:15:24.027 --> 00:15:26.112
Games stress me out!

00:15:27.155 --> 00:15:29.157
If you ever win, it'll all go away.

00:15:29.491 --> 00:15:30.492
Don't break anything, okay?

00:15:31.868 --> 00:15:33.078
Your thing's going off!

00:15:33.203 --> 00:15:34.329
Oh, you're right.

00:15:35.455 --> 00:15:36.331
Is it monsters?!

00:15:36.915 --> 00:15:39.334
I am so ready to kick
the friggin' snot out of 'em!

00:15:40.126 --> 00:15:43.004
It says other Class S heroes
headed there immediately.

00:15:43.505 --> 00:15:46.216
By the time we get there,
it'll probably be all over.

00:15:48.009 --> 00:15:49.970
Speaking of which, Saitama...

00:15:50.512 --> 00:15:53.890
All these dead monsters
near my house frighten me.

00:15:54.182 --> 00:15:55.892
It seems kinda unsanitary...

00:15:56.226 --> 00:15:58.937
Cool, I'll have Genos
incinerate them later.

00:15:59.479 --> 00:16:06.570
But I wonder...

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:06.403
DANGEROUS AREA
NO ENTRY BEYOND THIS POINT

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:09.990
If monsters start to show up
everywhere like yesterday,

00:16:10.323 --> 00:16:12.659
there might be more
neighborhoods like mine.

00:16:13.535 --> 00:16:15.203
Where is Genos anyway?

00:16:15.495 --> 00:16:17.872
He hasn't been home
since yesterday.

00:16:18.039 --> 00:16:19.874
What? Is he all right?

00:16:20.375 --> 00:16:22.544
There's like a Monster Association now.

00:16:22.836 --> 00:16:25.171
Maybe they got him.

00:16:27.382 --> 00:16:29.551
It's Genos. He's probably fine.

00:16:37.058 --> 00:16:38.184
Maybe I'll have a look.

00:16:41.896 --> 00:16:46.067
A Class S...
Thank goodness.

00:16:49.696 --> 00:16:50.864
This one's strong...

00:16:51.364 --> 00:16:54.284
His speed is the real deal and
he's got Tank-top Master's power.

00:16:54.909 --> 00:16:57.829
He tires those incineration
cannons without hesitation.

00:16:58.538 --> 00:17:00.790
Busted up like this,
It take a lot to beat him.

00:17:02.917 --> 00:17:04.044
Damn it...

00:17:08.632 --> 00:17:09.633
Give it up.

00:17:09.966 --> 00:17:11.760
There is no way
you can escape from me.

00:17:13.928 --> 00:17:14.929
That's what I need...

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:17.599
Have to remember
the way he moved!

00:17:20.518 --> 00:17:22.228
He changed his style.

00:17:23.146 --> 00:17:24.439
He's moving on all fours!

00:17:25.523 --> 00:17:26.483
Shake.

00:17:28.068 --> 00:17:31.112
I've always been good
with precision machinery!

00:17:31.488 --> 00:17:33.323
Mainly at breaking it!

00:17:41.748 --> 00:17:42.749
Meaningless.

00:17:45.293 --> 00:17:47.170
One after another...

00:17:47.629 --> 00:17:50.924
I must've really gotten
the attention of you heroes!

00:17:51.925 --> 00:17:54.135
Makes me happy to be so popular!

00:17:55.011 --> 00:17:57.764
The appearance of
an evil organization

00:17:57.847 --> 00:17:59.599
has thrown the world into chaos.

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:06.523
The Hero Association must work
as one to deal with that threat.

00:18:08.983 --> 00:18:12.404
We do not have time to waste
on nobodies like you.

00:18:14.072 --> 00:18:16.157
You think I'm a nobody?!

00:18:17.117 --> 00:18:19.828
Then help me change that,
Demon Cyborg!

00:18:20.203 --> 00:18:21.287
Once I've beaten you,

00:18:21.371 --> 00:18:24.124
the world will fear me more,
won't they?!

00:18:37.887 --> 00:18:39.347
Tell them all.

00:18:40.056 --> 00:18:42.016
No hero is a match for me.

00:18:42.684 --> 00:18:44.769
A monster stronger
than anyone else...

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:47.105
...IS right here!

00:18:48.064 --> 00:18:50.066
No such thing exists.

00:18:51.234 --> 00:18:52.193
Now!

00:18:52.694 --> 00:18:54.821
Rescue the hero hunter!

00:18:58.199 --> 00:18:59.033
What the...?

00:18:59.117 --> 00:19:01.369
The Monster Association,
at your service.

00:19:01.703 --> 00:19:04.080
We've come to bring you
back with us, Mr. Garou.

00:19:04.205 --> 00:19:07.041
You're in a pinch, right?
We will help you.

00:19:07.709 --> 00:19:09.169
You guys again?

00:19:09.502 --> 00:19:13.882
Our superiors say they'll offer you
an executive position.

00:19:14.007 --> 00:19:15.300
Isn't that wonderful?

00:19:15.383 --> 00:19:16.050
Don't want it.

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:17.969
Piss off.

00:19:18.428 --> 00:19:21.181
I'm afraid we can't, not this time.

00:19:21.556 --> 00:19:23.600
We're here under orders.

00:19:26.394 --> 00:19:27.353
This can't be...

00:19:31.566 --> 00:19:36.404
The hero hunter...in league
with the Monster Association?

00:19:36.571 --> 00:19:37.405
Huh'?!

00:19:37.489 --> 00:19:38.740
Yesterday, I lost.

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:43.077
But I learned there are monsters
more powerful than I could imagine.

00:19:43.411 --> 00:19:45.413
Now, no matter what threat
may appear,

00:19:45.538 --> 00:19:47.457
my guard will never be down again.

00:19:48.917 --> 00:19:52.128
Plus, I am stronger
than I was yesterday.

00:19:55.757 --> 00:20:00.845
Master Saitama said to aim for
a higher level and train my spirit.

00:20:01.679 --> 00:20:03.681
I begin to understand
what he meant.

00:20:04.516 --> 00:20:06.392
It will take more than this
to defeat me.

00:20:07.227 --> 00:20:08.728
Master Saitama?

00:20:09.646 --> 00:20:13.149
There is a hero
stronger than all others

00:20:13.274 --> 00:20:14.442
who no monster can match.

00:20:18.112 --> 00:20:18.863
Incinerate.

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:25.620
Genos.

00:20:26.079 --> 00:20:26.579
Bang...

00:20:27.121 --> 00:20:29.582
Would you mind
letting us handle this?

00:20:34.003 --> 00:20:36.214
Fist of Whirling Wind,
Slashing Steel!

00:20:42.512 --> 00:20:44.973
Let me handle the monsters, Bang.

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:46.391
You take Garou.

00:20:46.975 --> 00:20:48.518
Thank you, Big Brother.

00:20:52.313 --> 00:20:53.523
Now then...

00:20:54.649 --> 00:20:57.735
We meet once more, Garou.

00:21:00.572 --> 00:21:02.156
That voice...

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:07.370
The world's most annoying
old geezer is here for me?

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:10.665
What the hell happened to you?

00:21:11.791 --> 00:21:14.544
I'll end it for you.
On your feet!

00:21:35.899 --> 00:21:37.150
Are you strong?

00:21:38.985 --> 00:21:41.404
Who is this cocky kid'?

00:21:48.244 --> 00:21:50.663
Master, shall I toss the brat out?

00:21:56.711 --> 00:21:57.712
No.

00:21:58.254 --> 00:22:02.425
When he wakes Up,
feed him until he's full.

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:15.271
Fist of Flowing Water
Crushing Rock!

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:31.245
We painted different dreams
into our hearts

00:22:31.329 --> 00:22:36.084
With the struggles that we faced
In the past

00:22:36.584 --> 00:22:42.090
Will the future call
or Will it slio away?

00:22:42.131 --> 00:22:47.095
There's just so much
that we don't know

00:22:47.345 --> 00:22:52.558
But one day, weil make peace
within ourselves

00:22:47.345 --> 00:22:52.558
But one day, we'll make peace
within ourselves

00:22:52.809 --> 00:22:58.271
Weil be able to forgive
everything in our past

00:22:58.272 --> 00:23:03.444
We tell ourselves to forget,
but nothing seems to fade

00:23:03.486 --> 00:23:07.532
That's what we are to each other

00:23:07.615 --> 00:23:13.913
If you hold out your hand
Youll see the bonds that show us

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:18.459
That kindness Is the true strength

00:23:18.501 --> 00:23:24.882
Theyre something that I need
To keep on moving on

00:23:24.966 --> 00:23:30.263
So I promise that I'll come back

00:23:30.346 --> 00:23:36.144
I promise that lil come back to you

00:23:30.346 --> 00:23:36.144
I promise that I'll come back to you

00:23:45.528 --> 00:23:50.283
THE WIPING OF THE DISCIPLE'S BUTT
